2026-08-16T11:42:53Z    [ADI:Revenue] GATE critic: The only cited guidance for FY2026Q3 is “we are forecasting revenue of $3.9 billion, +/- $100 million,” which implies a midpoint of exactly 3,900 USDm and a range of 3,800–4,000 USDm. Your calculation instead anchors to 3,929.25 USDm (an unsupported adjustment to the midpoint) and then blends in a seasonal trend (2,813.07) to arrive at 3,894.64. That blend is not justified by the source and introduces spurious precision; the defendable point estimate from the evidence is 3,900 USDm, not 3,894.64.
