2026-08-16T11:45:11Z    [HAS:Pre-exceptional operating profit] GATE critic: Unit mismatch in the blend: you add guidance_anchor 45.2 (GBPm) to seasonal_trend 0.247764 as if it were also in GBPm. 0.247764 is almost certainly a rate (~24.7764%), not £0.25m. Blending a monetary figure with a percentage (weights 0.967/0.033) makes 43.7099 unit-misaligned; if a 24.7764% seasonal effect was intended, it should be applied multiplicatively to 45.2 (or converted to GBPm against an appropriate base), not added.
